Cell["\<\
A glued surface is a composition of the operations, the cylinder being the \
identity; summing over all insertions of the incoming strings and all \
compositions gives the relations, here the involutivity relation, the bracket \
of the two halves of a cut string vanishing:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4baac664-f3ba-4ce1-966f-f834b092e2f3"],

